<title>FRANCE: Algerian guerrillas killed 34 in ambush - papers.</title>
<headline>Algerian guerrillas killed 34 in ambush - papers.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moslem guerrillas killed 34 people in a southern Algerian town, including 20 bus passengers who had their throats slit, Algerian newspapers said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The official death toll given earlier by Algerian security forces for the attack on the bus on Monday night was nine.</p>
</text>
